  <diagram id="gdw2iJMZYoywxcUPizNc" name="Page-23">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2280" dy="1933" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n!theme plain\n\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;Times New Roman\&quot;\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\n\nskinparam sequence {\n  ParticipantFontName \&quot;Times New Roman\&quot;\n  ParticipantFontSize 14\n  MessageFontName \&quot;Times New Roman\&quot;\n  TitleFontName \&quot;Times New Roman\&quot;\n}\n\ntitle Biểu đồ tuần tự cho Use-case Tương tác chatbot tra cứu sách\n\nautonumber\n\nactor User\nparticipant \&quot;ChatWidget\&quot; as ChatWidget\nparticipant \&quot;Chatbot Service\\n(Botpress)\&quot; as ChatbotService\nparticipant \&quot;Library API\\n(/api/books)\&quot; as LibraryAPI\ndatabase \&quot;Database\\n(MySQL)\&quot; as DB\n\nUser -&gt; ChatWidget: Gửi câu hỏi tìm sách\\n\&quot;Tìm sách về Python\&quot;\nactivate ChatWidget\n\nChatWidget -&gt; ChatbotService: Gửi message\\n{text: \&quot;Tìm sách về Python\&quot;, user_id}\nactivate ChatbotService\n\nChatbotService -&gt; ChatbotService: Phân tích intent\\nvà extract keywords\nnote right: Intent: search_books\\nKeywords: \&quot;Python\&quot;\n\nChatbotService -&gt; LibraryAPI: GET /api/books\\n?search=Python&amp;page=1&amp;limit=10\nactivate LibraryAPI\n\nLibraryAPI -&gt; DB: SELECT s.*, nxb.ten, COUNT(*) OVER() as total\\nFROM sach s\\nLEFT JOIN nha_xuat_ban nxb\\nWHERE (LOWER(tieu_de) LIKE &#39;%python%&#39;\\n  OR LOWER(tac_gia) LIKE &#39;%python%&#39;)\\nLIMIT 10 OFFSET 0\nactivate DB\n\nDB --&gt; LibraryAPI: Danh sách sách\\n(id, title, authors, publisher, total, ...)\ndeactivate DB\n\nLibraryAPI -&gt; DB: SELECT url_anh FROM anh_sach\\nWHERE id_sach IN (...) AND la_anh_dai_dien=1\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; LibraryAPI: Primary images\ndeactivate DB\n\nLibraryAPI --&gt; ChatbotService: JSON Response\\n{\\n  items: [BookListItem],\\n  page: 1,\\n  limit: 10,\\n  total: 15\\n}\ndeactivate LibraryAPI\n\nChatbotService -&gt; ChatbotService: Format response\\nthành câu trả lời tự nhiên\nnote right: \&quot;Tôi tìm thấy 15 cuốn sách về Python.\\nDưới đây là 10 cuốn đầu tiên:\\n\\n1. Python Programming - Tác giả: ...\\n2. Learn Python - Tác giả: ...\\n...\&quot;\n\nChatbotService --&gt; ChatWidget: Response message\\n{\\n  text: \&quot;Tôi tìm thấy 15 cuốn sách...\&quot;,\\n  books: [BookListItem],\\n  type: \&quot;book_list\&quot;\\n}\ndeactivate ChatbotService\n\nChatWidget -&gt; User: Hiển thị câu trả lời\\nvà danh sách sách\nnote right: Hiển thị:\\n- Text: \&quot;Tôi tìm thấy 15 cuốn sách về Python\&quot;\\n- Danh sách sách với ảnh bìa\\n- Nút \&quot;Xem thêm\&quot; nếu có nhiều kết quả\n\ndeactivate ChatWidget\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="PmgwEiIJuXbHZoE3lBNi-1">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1059" width="1179" x="-180" y="-130" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
